    "animation": "0-0.5s: The existing right thumb and index separate once, releasing the ONE gold coin straight down into the hat. 0.5-1.3s: It falls under gravity, tips gently on the felt and settles face up in the clear central space above the four ordinary coins. 1.3-2s: The empty hand withdraws through the upper-right edge. 2-3s: Hold the exact End Frame: five coins total, no hand. Camera locked. @Image1 defines only the existing gold coin, its engraving, thin reeded edge and small scale. Preserve hat shape, floor, shoes, lighting and the original four coins. No transformation, feather, glow, floating, extra coin, new hand, extra fingers, camera move or internal cut."
